@startuml
title Storage Route Resolution - Implemented Direct Mode
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor Caller
participant DefaultStorageRouteResolver as Resolver
participant HashShardRouteResolver as Shard
participant RouteMappingStrategy as Mapping

Caller -> Resolver : resolve(request)
Resolver -> Shard : resolve(request)
Shard -> Shard : hash key, floorMod, derive indexes
Shard --> Resolver : ShardRouteInfo
Resolver -> Mapping : map(shardInfo)
Mapping --> Resolver : PhysicalStorageLocation
Resolver -> Resolver : build StorageRoute with request metadata\nand typed shard / physical location
Resolver --> Caller : StorageRoute

note over Resolver, Mapping
Missing shard or mapping results fail immediately.
The configured mapping determines the table prefix.
No JDBC execution or transaction begins here.
end note
@enduml
